000100* ===============================================================*
000200* PROGRAM    : CLRFR990                                          *
000300* TITLE      : CLAIMANT VELOCITY SCORE                           *
000400* STATUS     : ARCHIVED - RETIRED 2018, NOT COMPILED             *
000500* SYSTEM     : CLARA                                             *
000600* ---------------------------------------------------------------*
000700* ARCHIVED PROGRAM CLRFR990 (RETIRED 2018) COMPUTED A            *
000800* 'VELOCITY SCORE' FROM A CLAIMANT'S CLAIMS IN THE PREVIOUS      *
000900* 90 DAYS.                                                       *
001000* INPUT IS A SEQUENTIAL CLAIM HISTORY FILE SORTED BY CLAIMANT;   *
001100* OUTPUT IS ONE SCORE RECORD PER CLAIMANT.                       *
001200* ===============================================================*
001300 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001400 PROGRAM-ID.    CLRFR990.
001500 AUTHOR.        CLARA PROJECT TEAM.
001600 DATE-WRITTEN.  1997-09.
001700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001900 FILE-CONTROL.
002000     SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO INFILE
002100        FILE STATUS IS WS-IN-STATUS.
002200     SELECT OUT-FILE ASSIGN TO OUTFILE
002300        FILE STATUS IS WS-OUT-STATUS.
002400 DATA DIVISION.
002500 FILE SECTION.
002600 FD  IN-FILE RECORDING MODE IS F.
002700 01  IN-REC.
002800     05  IN-CLAIMANT-REF         PIC X(10).
002900     05  IN-CLAIM-REF            PIC X(12).
003000     05  IN-LOSS-DATE            PIC X(8).
003100     05  IN-PERIL                PIC X(4).
003200     05  IN-AMOUNT               PIC S9(9)V99.
003300     05  FILLER                  PIC X(20).
003400 FD  OUT-FILE RECORDING MODE IS F.
003500 01  OUT-REC                     PIC X(133).
003600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003700 01  WS-STATUS.
003800     05  WS-IN-STATUS            PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
003900     05  WS-OUT-STATUS           PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
004000     05  WS-EOF                  PIC X      VALUE 'N'.
004100        88  END-OF-INPUT                       VALUE 'Y'.
004200 01  WS-COUNTS.
004300     05  WS-READ-CNT            PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004400     05  WS-WRITTEN-CNT         PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004500     05  WS-SKIPPED-CNT         PIC S9(7) COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
004600 01  WS-VELOCITY.
004700     05  WS-WINDOW-DAYS          PIC 9(3)   VALUE 090.
004800     05  WS-CUR-CLAIMANT         PIC X(10)  VALUE SPACES.
004900     05  WS-CLAIMS-IN-WINDOW     PIC 9(3)   VALUE ZERO.
005000     05  WS-AMOUNT-IN-WINDOW     PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3 VALUE ZERO.
005100     05  WS-VELOCITY-SCORE       PIC 9(3)   VALUE ZERO.
005200     05  WS-RUN-INT              PIC S9(9)  COMP VALUE ZERO.
005300     05  WS-LOSS-INT             PIC S9(9)  COMP VALUE ZERO.
005400 01  WS-LINE.
005500     05  WL-KEY                  PIC X(12).
005600     05  FILLER                  PIC X(2)   VALUE SPACES.
005700     05  WL-TEXT                 PIC X(60).
005800     05  WL-AMOUNT               PIC -(9)9.99.
005900     05  FILLER                  PIC X(46)  VALUE SPACES.
006000 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
006100 0000-MAIN.
006200     OPEN INPUT IN-FILE OUTPUT OUT-FILE
006300     PERFORM 1000-READ
006400     PERFORM 2000-PROCESS UNTIL END-OF-INPUT
006500     DISPLAY 'CLRFR990 READ ' WS-READ-CNT
006600           ' WRITTEN ' WS-WRITTEN-CNT
006700     CLOSE IN-FILE OUT-FILE
006800     STOP RUN.
006900 1000-READ.
007000     READ IN-FILE
007100        AT END SET END-OF-INPUT TO TRUE
007200        NOT AT END ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT
007300     END-READ.
007400 2000-PROCESS.
007500     IF IN-CLAIMANT-REF NOT = WS-CUR-CLAIMANT
007600        IF WS-CUR-CLAIMANT NOT = SPACES
007700           PERFORM 3000-COMPUTE-VELOCITY-SCORE
007800        END-IF
007900        MOVE IN-CLAIMANT-REF TO WS-CUR-CLAIMANT
008000        MOVE ZERO TO WS-CLAIMS-IN-WINDOW WS-AMOUNT-IN-WINDOW
008100     END-IF
008200     COMPUTE WS-LOSS-INT = FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE
008300           (FUNCTION NUMVAL(IN-LOSS-DATE))
008400     IF WS-RUN-INT - WS-LOSS-INT <= WS-WINDOW-DAYS
008500        ADD 1 TO WS-CLAIMS-IN-WINDOW
008600        ADD IN-AMOUNT TO WS-AMOUNT-IN-WINDOW
008700     END-IF
008800     PERFORM 1000-READ.
008900 3000-COMPUTE-VELOCITY-SCORE.
009000* SCORE RISES WITH CLAIMS IN THE WINDOW, CAPPED AT 100
009100     COMPUTE WS-VELOCITY-SCORE = WS-CLAIMS-IN-WINDOW * 20
009200     IF WS-VELOCITY-SCORE > 100
009300        MOVE 100 TO WS-VELOCITY-SCORE
009400     END-IF
009500     MOVE WS-CUR-CLAIMANT TO WL-KEY
009600     MOVE 'VELOCITY SCORE' TO WL-TEXT
009700     MOVE WS-VELOCITY-SCORE TO WL-AMOUNT
009800     WRITE OUT-REC FROM WS-LINE
009900     ADD 1 TO WS-WRITTEN-CNT.
010000 5000-FORMAT-DATE-1.
