010200     IF IN-CLAIMANT-REF = LOW-VALUES
010300        MOVE SPACES TO IN-CLAIMANT-REF
010400     END-IF
010500     INSPECT IN-CLAIMANT-REF REPLACING ALL LOW-VALUES BY SPACES.
